WEBVTT

01:41.789 --> 01:48.970
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.320 --> 01:51.720
[Episode 13]

02:09.470 --> 02:10.000
Who is it?

02:10.910 --> 02:12.440
Shen Fuxuan, are you awake?

02:14.000 --> 02:14.710
Yes.

02:21.079 --> 02:21.750
Coming.

02:23.520 --> 02:24.310
Morning.

02:25.310 --> 02:26.570
Did you get this for me?

02:27.000 --> 02:27.800
Thank you.

02:28.960 --> 02:29.750
Well,

02:30.360 --> 02:32.760
I got this last night
in case you got hungry.

02:34.800 --> 02:35.470
Morning.

02:38.160 --> 02:39.280
Why are you here?

02:39.910 --> 02:41.040
Surprising, right?

02:42.870 --> 02:43.910
You two wait here for a bit.

02:43.910 --> 02:45.079
I'll go change my clothes,

02:45.079 --> 02:47.680
and then we can go down
for breakfast together.

03:07.520 --> 03:10.560
I don't think you should drink coffee
on an empty stomach.

03:10.560 --> 03:11.690
I need to drink some.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.120
I didn't dare to sleep last night,

03:13.120 --> 03:15.120
so I'm afraid I'll get sleepy later.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.400
Thanks to you,

03:16.560 --> 03:18.160
I slept very well last night.

03:18.840 --> 03:19.630
Thank you.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.820
You didn't sleep well last night either?

03:32.280 --> 03:34.079
I'm not used to unfamiliar beds.

03:39.870 --> 03:41.280
It's time. I have to go.

03:43.520 --> 03:45.320
I'll attend your presentation.

03:45.710 --> 03:46.430
Really?

03:46.800 --> 03:47.590
Of course.

03:49.910 --> 03:51.100
It's such an important occasion.

03:51.100 --> 03:52.360
How could I miss it?

03:56.870 --> 03:57.930
See you later then.

03:58.030 --> 03:58.840
See you later.

03:59.660 --> 04:01.030
See you later, Shen Fuxuan.

04:01.030 --> 04:01.840
See you later.

04:18.899 --> 04:22.790
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

04:23.270 --> 04:24.480
Okay, thank you.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.070
Today,

04:26.120 --> 04:28.480
we have a special segment.

04:28.750 --> 04:30.800
We've invited a high school student

04:30.800 --> 04:32.240
to interpret and discuss

04:32.240 --> 04:34.950
marine issues from her perspective.

04:34.950 --> 04:36.000
Please welcome

04:36.000 --> 04:39.070
Lin Zhixia, a high school student
from Nanhai No. 1 High School.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.670
A round of applause, please.

04:42.040 --> 04:45.110
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

04:48.720 --> 04:50.080
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

05:03.720 --> 05:04.720
Hello, everyone.

05:04.920 --> 05:08.190
I'm the high school student
representative today, Lin Zhixia.

05:08.190 --> 05:10.160
I was very nervous backstage just now.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.190
Seeing so many outstanding experts
and scholars

05:12.190 --> 05:14.120
engaging in in-depth discussions

05:14.190 --> 05:16.120
made me, as a student, realize that

05:16.120 --> 05:18.520
the academic path
is a long and arduous one.

05:19.160 --> 05:21.240
Today I want to share with you

05:21.240 --> 05:22.680
a topic that is closely related to us.

05:22.680 --> 05:24.510
Don't take photos. You'll distract her.

05:24.510 --> 05:25.630
What do you know?

05:25.650 --> 05:27.110
I've turned off the flash.

05:27.160 --> 05:29.220
I'm recording her highlight moment.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.170
Point it up a bit.

05:31.190 --> 05:33.430
It has already attracted
widespread attention.

05:33.430 --> 05:36.630
But today I want to specifically
discuss microplastics.

05:39.560 --> 05:41.720
There is currently
no unified definition of microplastics.

05:41.720 --> 05:43.360
They generally refer to
plastic fragments at the millimeter

05:43.360 --> 05:45.390
or even micrometer level.

05:45.830 --> 05:48.090
Actually, this topic is quite advanced.

05:50.200 --> 05:50.740
What.

05:51.800 --> 05:53.130
What do you mean by that?

05:53.800 --> 05:55.690
I'm afraid you won't understand it.

05:55.690 --> 05:57.740
Actually, you can go home
and brush up on the basics.

05:57.740 --> 05:59.000
Don't force yourself.

06:01.000 --> 06:03.180
When have you scored better than me
on an exam this semester?

06:03.180 --> 06:05.440
If anyone doesn't understand, it's you.

06:06.280 --> 06:08.140
This is a Marine Science Seminar.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.600
Have you forgotten who my mom is?

06:09.600 --> 06:10.700
I've been immersed in it since childhood.

06:10.700 --> 06:13.000
Even my bedtime stories
were about oceanography.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.950
Thus, they enter the food chain.

06:15.190 --> 06:17.870
This causes problems for the creatures,
including indigestion, energy deficiency,

06:17.870 --> 06:20.040
injury, poisoning, and even death.

06:21.270 --> 06:22.470
As we just mentioned,

06:22.480 --> 06:25.480
microplastics enter the ocean
through various pathways.

06:25.480 --> 06:27.920
Now let's see what those pathways are.

06:30.270 --> 06:32.390
There are 4 main pathways of input.

06:32.870 --> 06:34.000
Lifestyle pathway.

06:34.159 --> 06:35.920
Our daily domestic wastewater

06:35.920 --> 06:37.870
will all be discharged into the ocean.

06:37.870 --> 06:39.200
Laundry wastewater...

07:12.430 --> 07:18.370
[The Harm of Microplastics
to the Nanhai Ecosystem]

07:26.920 --> 07:29.130
[The Harm of Microplastics
to the Nanhai Ecosystem]

07:29.920 --> 07:31.120
Fourth, and most importantly,

07:31.120 --> 07:32.950
is to raise public awareness.

07:37.610 --> 07:42.350
[Thanks]

07:39.800 --> 07:42.510
Due to a lack of systematic study
in oceanography,

07:42.510 --> 07:43.190
my research

07:43.190 --> 07:45.390
remains at a relatively superficial stage.

07:45.390 --> 07:47.070
I would like to express my special thanks

07:47.070 --> 07:48.890
to Professor Shen Zhaohua's lab team

07:48.890 --> 07:50.560
for their patient guidance.

07:50.650 --> 07:52.120
With their help,

07:52.159 --> 07:53.430
I was able to collect seawater samples

07:53.430 --> 07:55.850
and offshore sediments
of Nanhai Province shores,

07:55.850 --> 07:57.190
and more effectively observe

07:57.190 --> 08:00.450
the distribution and
pollution status of microplastics.

08:00.560 --> 08:02.430
I think in the next decade,

08:02.630 --> 08:04.160
microplastics are very likely to become

08:04.160 --> 08:06.960
one of the biggest challenges
in global ocean governance.

08:06.960 --> 08:09.040
I hope the treatment
and prevention of microplastics

08:09.040 --> 08:11.240
will become an issue that everyone
pays more attention to.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.560
I also hope my sharing

08:12.580 --> 08:14.850
can provide you with some new ideas.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.720
That concludes my presentation for today.

08:16.720 --> 08:17.630
Thank you all.

08:45.960 --> 08:48.440
Later, make a copy of your slides today

08:48.600 --> 08:50.150
for Ms. Guan.

08:58.930 --> 09:00.420
Great. So excellent.

09:00.450 --> 09:01.530
When she was still young,

09:01.530 --> 09:02.840
I met her at the aquarium.

09:02.840 --> 09:04.670
So she is really a gifted talent.

09:04.760 --> 09:05.880
The reason I invited her

09:05.880 --> 09:07.880
is that our team needs such a talent.

09:08.510 --> 09:10.100
Xia, Ms. Guan here is

09:10.100 --> 09:11.440
a prominent teacher in the field

09:11.440 --> 09:13.100
with her own unique insights on the

09:13.100 --> 09:15.300
future development of marine science.

09:46.410 --> 09:47.370
I'm back.

09:52.460 --> 09:53.520
Baihui, come here.

09:58.140 --> 10:00.720
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

10:04.340 --> 10:05.170
Explain this.

10:07.940 --> 10:08.870
This... This...

10:08.890 --> 10:11.700
I've noticed you haven't been as quick
to get up these past couple of days.

10:11.700 --> 10:12.980
I thought you had
finally figured things out

10:12.980 --> 10:14.580
and stayed up late studying.

10:14.700 --> 10:16.410
Turns out you were reading this.

10:16.410 --> 10:17.810
Where did this come from?

10:19.580 --> 10:20.290
Did you buy it yourself?

10:20.290 --> 10:20.980
No.

10:23.410 --> 10:23.870
This...

10:23.960 --> 10:26.110
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

10:24.370 --> 10:25.630
This is just...

10:27.820 --> 10:30.500
a gift from Lin Zhixia.

10:30.940 --> 10:32.070
but I didn't read it.

10:32.460 --> 10:34.050
A gift from Lin Zhixia?

10:35.010 --> 10:36.860
Do ace students have time to read this?

10:36.860 --> 10:38.580
They are all busy
doing practice questions.

10:38.580 --> 10:39.980
She knows that for this exam,

10:39.980 --> 10:41.250
your grades dropped so severely,

10:41.250 --> 10:42.980
yet she still gave you this leisure book?

10:42.980 --> 10:45.900
She is mocking you
for never being able to catch up to her!

10:45.900 --> 10:48.620
Baihui, we wouldn't hurt you.

10:49.500 --> 10:50.270
She has good grades.

10:50.270 --> 10:52.220
She's pretending to be your good friend

10:52.220 --> 10:54.100
to make you lower your guard.

10:54.120 --> 10:56.120
And you actually took it seriously.

11:02.570 --> 11:03.650
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

11:23.170 --> 11:24.890
Go, return it to her today.

11:25.770 --> 11:28.340
Dad, I swear I haven't read it.

11:28.340 --> 11:29.650
I will never talk to her again.

11:29.650 --> 11:30.580
As for this book,

11:31.130 --> 11:32.610
can I just throw it away myself?

11:32.610 --> 11:34.140
I'll pretend I never had it.

11:35.310 --> 11:37.600
If you won't go, I will.

11:37.700 --> 11:39.430
I will personally hand this book to her

11:39.430 --> 11:40.580
and let her reflect on

11:40.580 --> 11:41.580
her true intentions.

11:41.580 --> 11:43.220
Mom, if I really do it,

11:43.220 --> 11:45.620
-what will my classmates think of me?
-Is that important?

11:45.620 --> 11:47.250
Classmates are just competitors.

11:47.250 --> 11:48.340
When Lin Zhixia gave you the book,

11:48.340 --> 11:49.740
she was probably mocking you in her heart.

11:49.740 --> 11:50.800
Do you understand?

11:51.370 --> 11:52.130
But Dad...

11:52.130 --> 11:53.990
I'm not discussing this with you.

12:01.860 --> 12:02.740
I got it.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.130
You took photos?

12:32.340 --> 12:33.100
Let me see.

12:45.740 --> 12:46.740
Videos, too.

13:11.100 --> 13:12.340
You took so many.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.500
How did I do?

13:17.290 --> 13:18.010
Good.

13:18.290 --> 13:19.250
Really good.

13:36.250 --> 13:38.380
What do you think of my research topic?

13:38.820 --> 13:39.500
Good.

13:39.980 --> 13:40.770
Very good.

13:50.820 --> 13:51.620
A strawberry!

13:52.460 --> 13:54.120
These are all your favorites.

13:57.000 --> 13:58.500
We sat through a morning of reports.

13:58.500 --> 13:59.900
Haven't you seen enough?

14:01.480 --> 14:02.500
Eat something.

14:02.670 --> 14:03.650
You must be hungry.

14:03.650 --> 14:04.280
Eat up.

14:09.170 --> 14:09.770
By the way.

14:10.220 --> 14:11.980
My mom still has wrap-up work
this afternoon,

14:11.980 --> 14:13.110
so we have free time.

14:13.500 --> 14:15.300
Is there anything you want to do?

14:19.890 --> 14:21.700
A sci-fi blockbuster
was released recently.

14:21.700 --> 14:23.100
Let's go watch the movie.

14:23.220 --> 14:23.940
Sure.

14:33.550 --> 14:34.550
Where's my share?

14:36.340 --> 14:37.340
Go help yourself.

14:54.530 --> 14:56.360
[Currently Airing]

14:56.360 --> 15:01.740
[Snacks Ordering]

14:59.860 --> 15:01.290
Hello. How can I help you?

15:06.900 --> 15:08.820
These badges are so beautiful.

15:08.860 --> 15:11.200
These are badges
for the movie "Pale Blue Dot."

15:11.200 --> 15:13.030
Our cinema is having
a promotion right now.

15:13.030 --> 15:13.980
If you participate,

15:13.980 --> 15:15.710
you can check in and get a badge.

15:16.460 --> 15:17.390
What promotion?

15:17.390 --> 15:18.050
Right here.

15:18.530 --> 15:19.790
This is the promotion.

15:20.250 --> 15:22.910
[Exclusive Benefit for Couples]

15:21.100 --> 15:24.760
Couples can take a photo together
to get a limited-edition badge.

15:27.880 --> 15:32.810
[Capture the moment of love]

15:32.580 --> 15:34.910
This is the couples' photo check-in wall.

15:36.670 --> 15:38.390
[Capture the moment of love]

15:41.320 --> 15:43.120
Non-couples should be fine too.

15:43.340 --> 15:45.460
Why don't we take a photo together?

15:44.310 --> 15:46.430
[Winter Snow]

15:45.740 --> 15:47.270
We should be able to get the badge too.

15:47.270 --> 15:48.000
Makes sense.

15:50.410 --> 15:51.850
I don't think that's a good idea.

15:51.850 --> 15:54.560
[Capture the moment of love]

15:53.460 --> 15:54.620
What's wrong with it?

15:54.620 --> 15:55.680
Please. Thank you.

15:56.050 --> 15:57.780
You two, stand a little closer.

15:58.500 --> 15:59.300
Strike a pose.

16:00.240 --> 16:01.050
Let's do a peace sign.

16:01.050 --> 16:02.080
I'm going to take the picture now.

16:02.080 --> 16:02.600
Ready.

16:02.740 --> 16:05.650
Three, two, one.

16:18.230 --> 16:22.190
[Exclusively for couples]

16:18.790 --> 16:21.450
Here is the photo of you two.
Please keep it safe.

16:26.050 --> 16:27.980
This photo is really interesting.

16:28.580 --> 16:29.580
Can I keep it?

16:36.600 --> 16:37.600
I want this badge.

16:38.740 --> 16:39.550
Here you go.

16:42.480 --> 16:43.000
Thank you.

16:43.000 --> 16:43.930
You're welcome.

16:48.460 --> 16:50.340
Row 5, seats 9, 10, and 11.

16:52.290 --> 16:52.950
Right here.

16:54.740 --> 16:55.670
I'll go in first.

16:57.290 --> 16:58.100
Move inside.

17:12.550 --> 17:15.150
It's been a long time
since I came to the cinema.

18:13.710 --> 18:14.720
Shen Fuxuan.

18:15.980 --> 18:17.040
Hold out your hand.

18:19.470 --> 18:20.270
Both hands.

18:21.010 --> 18:21.850
Both.

18:22.500 --> 18:23.440
Both hands.

18:29.900 --> 18:32.760
It's more convenient to hold it
and eat it yourself.

18:47.060 --> 18:48.010
Is it enough?

19:21.050 --> 19:21.850
Jin Baihui?

19:27.350 --> 19:29.090
I'm Lin Zhixia's brother.

19:29.610 --> 19:30.500
My name is Lin Zeqiu.

19:30.500 --> 19:31.220
Hello.

19:31.220 --> 19:31.940
Hello.

19:32.570 --> 19:33.930
How do you know who I am?

19:34.900 --> 19:37.500
You are one of the top students
in my sister's class.

19:37.500 --> 19:38.330
I know you.

19:38.770 --> 19:40.280
And after the school anniversary,

19:40.280 --> 19:42.210
who in the school doesn't know you?

19:45.810 --> 19:47.810
Are you here to see my sister today?

19:50.380 --> 19:50.980
I...

19:59.610 --> 20:00.290
This...

20:01.250 --> 20:02.980
Please give this to Lin Zhixia.

20:10.290 --> 20:13.180
She's not at home. Maybe wait a bit?

20:23.740 --> 20:25.240
We are all stardust.

20:26.270 --> 20:28.740
Adrift in the same darkness.

20:30.550 --> 20:31.810
Even when we're apart,

20:32.940 --> 20:35.110
we are still under the same sky.

20:35.740 --> 20:37.370
We don't own each other,

20:37.880 --> 20:40.530
but we can light up
one another's darkness.

20:47.500 --> 20:48.960
I'm going to the restroom.

22:34.800 --> 22:36.200
Are you cold?

22:37.840 --> 22:38.570
This is hot.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.030
Hold it to warm up.

22:41.030 --> 22:41.630
Thank you.

22:41.960 --> 22:42.620
No problem.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.720
You haven't been here, have you?

22:53.200 --> 22:55.570
This is Lin Zhixia's and my secret base.

22:56.400 --> 22:57.460
She loves drawing.

23:00.900 --> 23:03.900
This is a drawing of our house
from when she was little.

23:04.590 --> 23:06.240
She drew it in kindergarten.

23:07.210 --> 23:09.220
No, in primary school.

23:11.200 --> 23:13.960
That one over there
is from kindergarten.

23:14.110 --> 23:14.900
And this one.

23:15.510 --> 23:16.140
This was

23:16.680 --> 23:18.290
also drawn in kindergarten.

23:19.750 --> 23:22.550
Her drawings were cuter back then.

23:23.190 --> 23:25.900
And these are from middle school.

23:25.960 --> 23:27.360
These are less childish.

23:27.470 --> 23:28.260
She said

23:28.280 --> 23:29.920
I was that little frog,

23:30.500 --> 23:33.560
and she'd be the umbrella to shelter me
when she grew up.

23:34.680 --> 23:36.060
Give me a break.

23:36.350 --> 23:38.210
Who knows who's protecting whom?

23:39.200 --> 23:39.930
Look at this.

23:41.300 --> 23:43.420
This is a seat from a minibus.

23:44.610 --> 23:47.750
We snatched it from a junk collector.

23:49.640 --> 23:50.900
It's actually broken.

23:51.480 --> 23:53.140
See, it has no leg on that side.

23:53.180 --> 23:54.090
See, we stacked bricks there

23:54.090 --> 23:55.950
to keep it steady and functional.

23:56.330 --> 23:57.250
Just like that.

23:57.690 --> 23:59.550
Here, there are bricks here, too.

23:59.820 --> 24:01.160
This one is broken too,

24:01.380 --> 24:03.240
but it works with bricks under it.

24:04.300 --> 24:05.830
My parents' supermarket had

24:05.830 --> 24:08.030
old vegetable crates. We put them here,

24:08.160 --> 24:11.290
threw a cloth over them,
and it became our space capsule.

24:12.530 --> 24:13.660
As for this cloth...

24:14.510 --> 24:16.420
I used it when I was little.

24:16.450 --> 24:17.720
It was my blanket.

24:19.210 --> 24:20.210
And there's more.

24:20.570 --> 24:22.050
The navigator sits here,

24:22.160 --> 24:24.160
and there's an accelerator inside.

24:26.750 --> 24:29.030
It's nice having siblings.

24:30.550 --> 24:31.770
It was all her idea.

24:32.640 --> 24:33.970
I just did what she said.

24:39.380 --> 24:40.610
But I like it here too.

24:42.310 --> 24:44.790
Because here you can see

24:45.310 --> 24:46.680
the whole sky.

24:56.200 --> 24:57.800
That's the Winter Triangle.

24:58.720 --> 25:00.120
Next to it is the Hexagon.

25:01.200 --> 25:02.260
It's very visible.

25:04.200 --> 25:06.530
Among them, Sirius, the closest one to us,

25:06.940 --> 25:08.400
is slowly approaching us.

25:12.920 --> 25:14.780
Are you interested in astronomy?

25:16.140 --> 25:18.940
I'm the president of
the school's astronomy club.

25:19.870 --> 25:21.200
Aren't you in any clubs?

25:22.350 --> 25:25.440
No. I'm afraid it'll affect my studies.

25:27.480 --> 25:28.680
Not really.

25:28.680 --> 25:30.540
You just need to manage your time.

25:31.570 --> 25:34.430
You can come check out
the astronomy club sometime.

25:34.680 --> 25:35.460
Besides,

25:36.030 --> 25:38.390
if you study all day,

25:38.530 --> 25:39.730
won't you go crazy?

25:51.880 --> 25:53.340
The movie was really good.

25:53.720 --> 25:55.200
Pale Blue Dot.

25:55.750 --> 25:57.350
The blue dot is our Earth.

25:57.680 --> 25:58.960
Alone in the universe,

25:58.960 --> 26:00.620
yet afraid of not being alone.

26:01.790 --> 26:02.850
It really was good.

26:04.070 --> 26:06.130
Were you actually paying attention?

26:10.830 --> 26:11.590
Hello, Mom.

26:13.750 --> 26:14.480
Okay.

26:15.070 --> 26:15.830
Got it.

26:18.770 --> 26:19.790
My mom is done over there.

26:19.790 --> 26:20.850
I need to head over.

26:21.830 --> 26:22.610
Do you want to...

26:22.610 --> 26:23.480
Go ahead.

26:23.880 --> 26:24.940
I'll take her home.

26:31.100 --> 26:32.070
Alright then.

26:32.340 --> 26:33.400
It's getting late.

26:33.960 --> 26:35.220
It's not safe outside.

26:36.680 --> 26:37.940
Go back and rest early.

26:39.480 --> 26:40.200
Let's go.

26:41.000 --> 26:42.070
Help me hold my bag.

26:59.590 --> 27:01.200
Is this book...

27:05.350 --> 27:07.830
Lin Zhixia gave this to me.

27:08.680 --> 27:10.160
My parents found out.

27:11.070 --> 27:13.670
They were afraid
it would affect my studies...

27:16.840 --> 27:18.440
So they asked me to return it.

27:25.440 --> 27:26.550
It's already torn like this.

27:26.550 --> 27:29.480
Why didn't you just throw it
in a trash can by the road?

27:32.350 --> 27:33.400
You're so honest,

27:33.790 --> 27:34.680
so naive.

27:37.350 --> 27:38.160
That's true.

27:45.590 --> 27:47.120
Alright then, give it to me.

27:50.950 --> 27:51.810
I'll handle it.

27:53.550 --> 27:55.610
Just say you've already returned it.

27:59.640 --> 28:00.400
Thank you.

28:06.640 --> 28:08.300
I guess I'm already used to it.

28:09.160 --> 28:11.160
I do whatever they tell me.

28:14.510 --> 28:17.240
Please say sorry to Lin Zhixia for me.

28:25.400 --> 28:27.060
She actually won't blame you.

28:31.880 --> 28:35.070
My sister didn't have many friends
when she was little.

28:36.210 --> 28:39.620
She was quite a misfit.

28:40.880 --> 28:41.750
So my parents

28:43.200 --> 28:45.930
were also very worried
about her making friends.

28:47.750 --> 28:49.160
If they knew you were coming today,

28:49.160 --> 28:50.960
they would have been very happy.

28:53.160 --> 28:53.880
I...

28:56.070 --> 28:58.400
I'm not sure if we're considered friends.

28:59.070 --> 29:00.270
She gave you a book,

29:00.400 --> 29:02.260
so you are definitely her friend.

29:08.750 --> 29:11.440
I think Lin Zhixia
is genuinely nice to me,

29:12.030 --> 29:13.960
but my parents always believe that

29:14.110 --> 29:17.370
she is purposely distracting me
with singing and leisure books.

29:17.370 --> 29:19.720
She's afraid I'd surpass her.

29:21.510 --> 29:24.440
Your parents are overthinking.
That's impossible.

29:26.960 --> 29:30.180
I'm not saying it's impossible
for you to surpass her.

29:30.830 --> 29:31.930
I mean...

29:32.400 --> 29:35.430
In this regard, my sister...

29:36.300 --> 29:37.920
Her brain, you know,

29:37.920 --> 29:40.590
is just a bit abnormal.

29:48.790 --> 29:50.450
But when she gave you the book,

29:51.160 --> 29:52.620
it must have been sincere.

30:09.900 --> 30:13.630
When I was a kid, I loved watching
the stars with my brother the most.

30:14.000 --> 30:15.170
Jiang Yubai, look.

30:15.710 --> 30:18.000
There are so many stars
in the sky tonight.

30:18.000 --> 30:18.590
Yeah.

30:21.480 --> 30:23.830
Are you also looking at Sirius?

30:24.790 --> 30:25.870
How did you know?

30:26.350 --> 30:27.770
Because the aliens in the movie

30:27.770 --> 30:29.090
were from Sirius.

30:31.750 --> 30:33.070
If you were given a chance

30:33.070 --> 30:35.110
to explore outer space for aliens,

30:35.590 --> 30:37.240
but you probably wouldn't be
able to come back,

30:37.240 --> 30:38.070
would you go?

30:40.310 --> 30:41.550
In life,

30:41.640 --> 30:43.200
people are naturally curious.

30:43.200 --> 30:45.800
We all want to see
what the universe looks like.

30:46.550 --> 30:48.080
But if I couldn't come back,

30:49.640 --> 30:50.550
I'd probably have too many

30:50.550 --> 30:52.350
emotional ties I can't let go of.

30:52.830 --> 30:53.750
I would go.

30:54.830 --> 30:56.240
Even if you can't come back?

30:56.240 --> 30:57.640
I don't need to come back.

30:58.000 --> 30:59.420
Once I find a new home,

30:59.440 --> 31:01.240
all humanity can just move over.

32:07.210 --> 32:08.100
Then you...

32:08.130 --> 32:08.860
I'm not cold.

32:18.440 --> 32:19.350
Did you know?

32:20.030 --> 32:22.880
Sirius is actually 8.6 light-years
away from us.

32:25.240 --> 32:27.980
Because its brightness
is 25 times that of the Sun,

32:27.980 --> 32:30.160
we can see it

32:30.180 --> 32:31.110
from so far away.

32:33.030 --> 32:33.680
This beam of light

32:33.680 --> 32:36.030
took 8.6 years to reach Earth.

32:36.920 --> 32:38.590
That means before we even met,

32:39.070 --> 32:40.310
it had already embarked

32:40.310 --> 32:41.960
on the journey to meet us.

32:51.310 --> 32:52.110
How romantic.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.400
Since

32:56.110 --> 32:58.110
it had such a hard time getting here,

32:58.330 --> 33:01.720
shall we take a photo with it
as a souvenir?

33:02.900 --> 33:03.710
Sure.

33:13.330 --> 33:14.570
It's right here.

33:14.600 --> 33:16.880
Ready, 3, 2, 1.

33:19.580 --> 33:20.960
It's a bit crooked.

33:21.080 --> 33:22.410
Let's take another one.

33:22.780 --> 33:25.010
Three, two, one.

33:25.880 --> 33:27.740
It's a bit blurry and out of focus.

33:28.640 --> 33:29.440
Let's take another one.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.770
Three, two, one.

33:33.130 --> 33:36.100
[Happiness is so simple]

33:33.660 --> 33:35.260
This one is a bit out of focus.

33:35.420 --> 33:36.750
Let's take another one.

33:37.720 --> 33:38.220
Three.

33:38.400 --> 33:39.800
The bus is here.

34:05.200 --> 34:07.750
Many of the photos we just took
are out of focus.

34:07.750 --> 34:09.810
Should we retake...

34:10.000 --> 34:14.340
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

34:15.010 --> 34:19.380
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

34:19.900 --> 34:22.880
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

34:23.460 --> 34:28.860
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

34:29.179 --> 34:33.610
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

34:34.159 --> 34:38.570
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

34:39.000 --> 34:42.179
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

34:42.750 --> 34:49.540
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

35:34.170 --> 35:35.500
Thank you, Jiang Yubai.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.550
I'm home.

35:37.610 --> 35:38.440
Then...

35:40.170 --> 35:41.700
See you at school next week.

35:56.760 --> 35:57.440
Here you go.

36:04.070 --> 36:05.470
Good night, Jiang Yubai.

36:06.440 --> 36:08.840
Good night, Lin Zhixia.

36:52.860 --> 36:53.670
Lin Zhixia!

36:55.990 --> 36:56.790
Come here!

36:58.040 --> 36:59.090
What's wrong?

36:59.920 --> 37:00.850
Where did you go?

37:01.110 --> 37:01.710
I...

37:01.710 --> 37:03.440
I called your hotel twice.

37:03.440 --> 37:04.590
They said you checked out this afternoon.

37:04.590 --> 37:06.590
Where did you go?
Why are you back so late?

37:06.590 --> 37:09.190
If you were 10 minutes later,
I would have called the police!

37:09.190 --> 37:10.480
The seminar was in the suburbs.

37:10.480 --> 37:11.800
It takes time for me to get back.

37:11.800 --> 37:12.630
You knew it would take time,

37:12.630 --> 37:14.160
so why didn't you call home?

37:15.190 --> 37:17.720
How could I call
when I don't even have a phone?

37:21.000 --> 37:21.550
Well...

37:25.000 --> 37:26.530
Then you need to get a phone.

37:40.110 --> 37:41.370
Mom, Dad, you're back.

37:41.710 --> 37:42.360
You...

37:42.360 --> 37:43.820
Why aren't you asleep yet?

37:44.400 --> 37:45.600
What are you two up to?

37:49.150 --> 37:51.150
We were waiting for you to come back.

37:54.710 --> 37:55.840
Is something wrong?

37:57.140 --> 37:58.570
Just drop it.

37:59.030 --> 37:59.990
No.

38:00.010 --> 38:01.270
I have to bring this up.

38:02.010 --> 38:02.990
What is it?

38:08.950 --> 38:10.750
I think Lin Zhixia needs a phone.

38:17.590 --> 38:18.510
Because she is a girl,

38:18.510 --> 38:19.400
it's not safe for her to be out alone.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.480
So she needs a phone.

38:20.480 --> 38:21.800
All her classmates have phones too.

38:21.800 --> 38:22.920
She looks out of place without one.

38:22.920 --> 38:24.580
Therefore, she needs a phone.

38:34.670 --> 38:35.590
Oh, about that.

38:36.000 --> 38:36.590
Actually,

38:36.590 --> 38:39.320
your mom and I
have already discussed this.

38:39.440 --> 38:40.840
The New Year is coming soon.

38:40.840 --> 38:42.150
Recently, the supermarket

38:42.150 --> 38:43.670
has stocked up on New Year goods.

38:43.670 --> 38:46.190
We were planning to buy you

38:46.510 --> 38:47.960
each a phone after

38:47.980 --> 38:49.150
the New Year.

38:49.150 --> 38:49.760
Yes.

38:50.880 --> 38:52.710
Dad, I don't need a phone right now.

38:52.710 --> 38:54.920
But please get one for Lin Zhixia first.

38:55.030 --> 38:56.560
And the sooner, the better.

39:26.100 --> 39:30.850
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

39:33.910 --> 39:36.350
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

39:39.710 --> 39:41.360
Why is it so blurry?

39:47.050 --> 39:48.250
It's all out of focus.

40:09.840 --> 40:12.030
Should we retake...
